# A continuous effect from a resolving ability is controlled by that ability's controller (CR 611.2a, 113.8), whoever
# controls its source by then. On turn 13 Bot1 casts The One Ring; with its "you gain protection from everything until your
# next turn" trigger on the stack, Bot2 - holding Dack Fayden's emblem since turn 12 - casts Pyroblast at the Ring (not
# blue, so it does nothing else) and the emblem gives Bot2 the Ring (checked). "You" is still Bot1: Bot2's Ragavan attacking
# Bot1 on turn 14 has all its damage prevented, so Bot1 stays at 20.

